Tool fs_official__read_text_file: Read the complete contents of a file from the file system as text. This is the primary tool for reading text files, replacing the deprecated 'read_file' tool. Handles various text encodings and provides detailed error messages if the file cannot be read. Use this tool when you need to examine the contents of a single file. Use the 'head' parameter to read only the first N lines of a file. Operates on the file as text regardless of extension. Only works within allowed directories.
Required arguments: path.
